{"summary":"猪牙石是一种产自西番的矿物，纹理似象牙，色如枣红。性未明确，主要功能是明目去翳，用于治疗眼疾。","sections":[{"kind":"names","title":"释名","original":"（《纲目》）\n\n时珍曰︰明目去翳。出西番，纹理如象牙，枣红色。","translation":"李时珍说：能够明目，去除眼翳。出产于西番，纹理像象牙，颜色为枣红色。"},{"kind":"form","title":"集解","original":""},{"kind":"preparation","title":"修治","original":""},{"kind":"properties","title":"气味","original":""},{"kind":"uses","title":"主治","original":""},{"kind":"commentary","title":"发明","original":""},{"kind":"prescriptions","title":"附方","original":""}],"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%9C%AC%E8%8D%89%E7%B6%B1%E7%9B%AE%2F%E9%87%91%E7%9F%B3%E4%B9%8B%E4%BA%94#豬牙石","retrievedAt":"2026-07-05T14:00:57.612Z"}